L000468	\subsection{$x$ lines}
L000469	Assuming the $x$ lines are critical, we fit $\xi_x/L$ to the scaling formula
L000470	\begin{equation}~\label{Equ_xix1}
L000471		\xi_x/L=a+bL^{-\omega},
